horizon times its finite parameter-uniform IID failure budget.
-/
theorem freshPerformativeTraceLawEmpiricalGradientMassDeviationUpToFailure_le_mul_totalFailure
    {Parameter Data : Type*} [Fintype Parameter] [DecidableEq Parameter]
    [Fintype Data] [DecidableEq Data]
    (initialLaw : PMF Parameter) (model : FinitePerformativeModel Parameter Data)
    (sampleCount : ℕ)
