/--
Finite-horizon probability bridge for Theorem 3.10.  If each round's empirical
gradient accuracy event is measurable, the finite union bound transfers their
individual failure probabilities to an absorbing-ball guarantee for the whole
empirical-RGD trajectory through that horizon.
